- Purview lineage, RBAC, BYOK, DR, and cost levers

Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: apply Laplace noise for DP on a sum
function dpSum(values, epsilon) {
  const clip = values.map(v => Math.max(-1.0, Math.min(1.0, v)));
  const s = clip.reduce((a,b) => a + b, 0);
  const noise = laplace(1/epsilon);
  return s + noise;
}
```

